title: Confluence OGNL Injection Exploitation
id: b62e160b-5da6-460a-bd76-63033ec1f7ef
status: experimental
description: Detects OGNL injection against Atlassian Confluence (CVE-2021-26084 / CVE-2022-26134), indicated by OGNL expressions and Runtime.getRuntime().exec payloads in the request path or query.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1190/
logsource:
  category: webserver
detection:
  selection:
    cs-uri-query|contains:
      - 'ognl'
      - 'Runtime@getRuntime'
      - '@java.lang.Runtime@'
      - '${@'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - cs-uri-query
  - cs-uri-stem
  - c-ip
falsepositives:
  - None expected
level: critical
tags:
  - attack.initial_access
  - attack.t1190
